  "notes": [
    "Book source is an encyclopedia, not a historic law book. Law-book label/cover ornament is a proposed game adaptation.",
    "Book 14 selected as a thick independent closed volume; source 20 books remain preserved.",
    "Rock originals have no prebuilt sword slot. A physical cavity or insert plate must be added by implementation.",
    "OBJ export preserves source geometry/UV/normals, flips UV V for OBJ, centers and uniformly normalizes largest extent to 1. Flat book uses proper cyclic axis rotation.",
    "glTF and FBX plus PBR originals preserved; OBJ MTL carries albedo/normal only. Unity smoothness/metallic setup should use separately supplied original maps.",
    "Official preview pictures are research reference images, not asserted to have the same license as source 3D assets."
  ],
